# AnkiRust.xcframework/ — deliberately TRACKED on this branch. Package.swift
# resolves it via binaryTarget(path:), so a consumer pinning this fork by SHA
# gets a buildable engine without a Rust toolchain, protoc, or a 20-minute
# cargo build. ~19 MB compressed per rebuild; rebuild with
# scripts/build-xcframework.sh and commit the result alongside a submodule bump.
